<\body>
  <chapter*|[6106] JSON 语言夜间模式高亮测试样例>

  <section*|1 行内 JSON 示例（夜间模式）>

  这是一个行内 JSON 属性对：<json|"name": "张三", "age": 25, "active": true, "score": 98.5>。

  <section*|2 综合 JSON 代码块（夜间模式）>

  <\json-code>
    {

    \ \ "name": "张三",

    \ \ "age": 25,

    \ \ "city": "北京",

    \ \ "height": 178.5,

    \ \ "isStudent": false,

    \ \ "avatar": null,

    \ \ "hobbies": ["读书", "游泳", "编程"],

    \ \ "education": {

    \ \ \ \ "degree": "学士",

    \ \ \ \ "major": "计算机科学与技术",

    \ \ \ \ "university": "清华大学",

    \ \ \ \ "graduationYear": 2024

    \ \ },

    \ \ "contacts": [

    \ \ \ \ {

    \ \ \ \ \ \ "type": "email",

    \ \ \ \ \ \ "value": "zhangsan@example.com",

    \ \ \ \ \ \ "primary": true

    \ \ \ \ },

    \ \ \ \ {

    \ \ \ \ \ \ "type": "phone",

    \ \ \ \ \ \ "value": "+86-13800138000",

    \ \ \ \ \ \ "primary": false

    \ \ \ \ }

    \ \ ]

    }
  </json-code>

  <section*|3 科学计数法与转义字符测试>

  <\json-code>
    {

    \ \ "scientific": 1.23e+10,

    \ \ "negativeExp": 4.56e-8,

    \ \ "zero": 0,

    \ \ "negativeInt": -42,

    \ \ "escapedString": "Line 1\\nLine 2\\tTabbed \\"Quoted\\" \\/ Slash \\\\ Backslash",

    \ \ "unicodeEscape": "\\u4e2d\\u6587\\u6d4b\\u8bd5"

    }
  </json-code>

  <section*|4 JSONC 注释支持测试>

  <\json-code>
    // 这是一个单行注释 (JSON with comments)

    {

    \ \ /* 多行块级注释

    \ \ \ \ 配置说明文档 */

    \ \ "enableFeature": true,

    \ \ "maxRetry": 3, // 行尾注释

    \ \ "timeoutMs": 5000

    }
  </json-code>
</body>

